        "id": 1334530
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-07-30T00:04:10Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Prefer to use a f-string instead of multiple `+` concatenation.\n\nhttps://google.github.io/styleguide/pyguide.html#310-strings\n\n```suggestion\n    if board in GPIO_WP_MAP:\n        wp_state \u003d GPIO_WP_ENABLE if enable_write_protect else GPIO_WP_DISABLE\n        renode_execute.append(f\"{GPIO_WP_MAP[board]} {wp_state};\")\n```",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 108,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 119,
        "endChar": 9
      },
      "revId": "8e5e4efbc7793b3bdad547c43c2cce6c8569b9ee",
      "serverId": "3ce6091f-6c88-37e8-8c75-72f92ae8dfba"
    },
